#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Basics of Quantum Phase Estimation (QPE) {#3-basics-of-quantum-phase-estimation-qpe}"
msgstr "3. 양자 위상 추정(QPE)의 기초 {#3-basics-of-quantum-phase-estimation-qpe}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Given a unitary operation $U$, the QPE estimates $\\theta$ in $U\\vert\\psi \\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} \\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$ since $U$ is unitary, all of its eigenvalues have a norm of 1.\n"
msgstr "유니터리 연산 $U$가 주어지면, QPE는 $U\\vert\\psi \\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} \\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$에서 $\\theta$를 추정합니다. $U$는 유니터리이므로 모든 고유값의 노름은 1입니다.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3.1 Procedure {#31-procedure}"
msgstr "3.1 절차 {#31-procedure}"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Setup {#1-setup}"
msgstr "1. 초기 설정 {#1-setup}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ is in one set of qubit registers. An additional set of $n$ qubits form the counting register on which we will store the value $2^n\\theta$:\n"
msgstr "$\\vert\\psi\\rangle$은 한 세트의 qubit 레지스터에 있습니다. 추가로 $n$개의 Qubit으로 구성된 계수 레지스터에 $2^n\\theta$ 값을 저장합니다:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_0\\rangle = \\lvert 0 \\rangle^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_0\\rangle = \\lvert 0 \\rangle^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Superposition {#2-superposition}"
msgstr "2. 중첩 {#2-superposition}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apply a $n$-bit Hadamard gate operation $H^{\\otimes n}$ on the counting register:\n"
msgstr "계수 레지스터에 $n$비트 Hadamard Gate 연산 $H^{\\otimes n}$을 적용합니다:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_1\\rangle = {\\frac {1}{2^{\\frac {n}{2}}}}\\left(|0\\rangle +|1\\rangle \\right)^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_1\\rangle = {\\frac {1}{2^{\\frac {n}{2}}}}\\left(|0\\rangle +|1\\rangle \\right)^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Controlled Unitary operations {#3-controlled-unitary-operations}"
msgstr "3. 제어 유니터리 연산 {#3-controlled-unitary-operations}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We need to introduce the controlled unitary $CU$ that applies the unitary operator $U$ on the target register only if its corresponding control bit is $|1\\rangle$. Since $U$ is a unitary operator with eigenvector $|\\psi\\rangle$ such that $U|\\psi \\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} \\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$, this means:\n"
msgstr "제어 Qubit이 $|1\\rangle$인 경우에만 목표 레지스터에 유니터리 연산자 $U$를 적용하는 제어 유니터리 $CU$가 필요합니다. $U$는 $U|\\psi \\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} \\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$를 만족하는 고유벡터 $|\\psi\\rangle$을 가진 유니터리 연산자이므로, 다음이 성립합니다:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U^{2^{j}}|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}U|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}e^{2\\pi i\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle =\\cdots =e^{2\\pi i2^{j}\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U^{2^{j}}|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}U|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}e^{2\\pi i\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle =\\cdots =e^{2\\pi i2^{j}\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3.2 Example: T-gate QPE {#32-example-t-gate-qpe}"
msgstr "3.2 예제: T-Gate QPE {#32-example-t-gate-qpe}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let's use $T$ gate as an example of QPE and estimate its phase $\\theta$.\n"
msgstr "QPE의 예제로 $T$ Gate를 사용하여 위상 $\\theta$를 추정해 보겠습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"T|1\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0\\\\\n"
"0 & e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0\\\\\n"
"1\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"T|1\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0\\\\\n"
"0 & e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0\\\\\n"
"1\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We expect to find:\n"
msgstr "기대 결과:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\frac{1}{8}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\frac{1}{8}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where\n"
msgstr "여기서\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"T|1\\rangle = e^{2i\\pi\\theta}|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"We initialize $\\vert\\psi\\rangle = \\vert1\\rangle$ of the eigenvector of $T$ gate by applying an $X$ gate:\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"T|1\\rangle = e^{2i\\pi\\theta}|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$X$ Gate를 적용하여 $T$ Gate의 고유벡터인 $\\vert\\psi\\rangle = \\vert1\\rangle$로 초기화합니다:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/2334e6e2-7ae2-4d4c-9014-3e6041f37ee7-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/2334e6e2-7ae2-4d4c-9014-3e6041f37ee7-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, we apply Hadamard gates to the counting qubits:\n"
msgstr "다음으로, 계수 Qubit에 Hadamard Gate를 적용합니다:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/9c020053-c369-4cc4-829e-72246d79f82c-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/9c020053-c369-4cc4-829e-72246d79f82c-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We perform the controlled unitary operations:\n"
msgstr "제어 유니터리 연산을 수행합니다:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/0b3bedfc-be73-427d-9eed-22a2d7df60cd-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/0b3bedfc-be73-427d-9eed-22a2d7df60cd-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We apply the inverse quantum Fourier transformation to convert the state of the counting register, then measure the counting register:\n"
msgstr "계수 레지스터의 상태를 변환하기 위해 역 양자 푸리에 변환을 적용한 후, 계수 레지스터를 측정합니다:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/df8ada87-4279-47bb-acd5-cb432bdfc998-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/df8ada87-4279-47bb-acd5-cb432bdfc998-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/5fcc8195-8fc9-47bc-9ef3-9d9d444db812-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/5fcc8195-8fc9-47bc-9ef3-9d9d444db812-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We can simulate using Aer simulator:\n"
msgstr "Aer 시뮬레이터를 사용하여 시뮬레이션할 수 있습니다:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/b0152311-8f60-4c11-a10e-a35691c0ece5-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/b0152311-8f60-4c11-a10e-a35691c0ece5-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We see we get one result (`001`) with certainty, which translates to the decimal: `1`. We now need to divide our result (`1`) by $2^n$ to get $\\theta$:\n"
msgstr "결과(`001`)가 확실하게 하나만 나오는 것을 확인할 수 있으며, 이는 십진수로 `1`에 해당합니다. 이제 결과(`1`)를 $2^n$으로 나누어 $\\theta$를 구합니다:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\frac{1}{2^3} = \\frac{1}{8}\n"
"$$\n"
" Shor's algorithm allows us to factorize a number by building a circuit with $\\theta$ unknown and obtaining $\\theta$.\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\frac{1}{2^3} = \\frac{1}{8}\n"
"$$\n"
" Shor 알고리즘을 사용하면 $\\theta$가 미지수인 Circuit을 구성하고 $\\theta$를 구함으로써 숫자를 인수분해할 수 있습니다.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3.3 Exercise {#33-exercise}"
msgstr "3.3 연습 문제 {#33-exercise}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Estimate $\\theta = 1/3$ using 3 qubits for counting and a qubit for an eigenvector.\n"
msgstr "계수를 위한 3개의 Qubit과 고유벡터용 1개의 Qubit을 사용하여 $\\theta = 1/3$을 추정하세요.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$P|1\\rangle = e^{i\\lambda}|1\\rangle$. Since we want to implement $U|1\\rangle = e^{2\\pi i \\tfrac{1}{3}}|1\\rangle$, we need to set $\\lambda = \\tfrac{2 \\pi}{3}$.\n"
msgstr "$P|1\\rangle = e^{i\\lambda}|1\\rangle$. $U|1\\rangle = e^{2\\pi i \\tfrac{1}{3}}|1\\rangle$을 구현하려면 $\\lambda = \\tfrac{2 \\pi}{3}$으로 설정해야 합니다.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Solution of the exercise: $\\theta = 1/3$ {#solution-of-the-exercise-theta-13}"
msgstr "연습 문제 풀이: $\\theta = 1/3$ {#solution-of-the-exercise-theta-13}"

